.TH "PIP-CACHE" "1" "Aug 05, 2026" "26.2" "pip"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
pip-cache \- description of pip cache command
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
Inspect and manage pip\(aqs wheel cache.
.sp
Subcommands:
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
dir: Show the cache directory.
.IP \(bu 2
info: Show information about the cache.
.IP \(bu 2
list: List filenames of packages stored in the cache.
.IP \(bu 2
remove: Remove one or more package from the cache.
.IP \(bu 2
purge: Remove all items from the cache.
.UNINDENT
.sp
\fB<pattern>\fP can be a glob expression or a package name.

.SH "نحوه استفاده (USAGE)"
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
python \-m pip cache dir
python \-m pip cache info
python \-m pip cache list [<pattern>] [\-\-format=[human, abspath]]
python \-m pip cache remove <pattern>
python \-m pip cache purge
.EE
.UNINDENT
.UNINDENT
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.sp
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-format <list_format>
Select the output format among: human (default) or abspath
.sp
(environment variable: \fBPIP_FORMAT\fP)
.UNINDENT

.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
pip developers
.SH "حق نشر (COPYRIGHT)"
The pip developers
